  welcomeMessage: Welcome to Lesson 9 Rimes Quiz!
  letsLearnMessage: In this quiz, you're going to type words that ends with the Rimes
    -em, ell, and -eb. Type the word with the correct spelling.
  completedMessage: Great job! You finished the Lesson 9 Rimes.
  repeatQuestionMessage: Do you want to repeat the quiz and try to beat your high
    score? Press repeat to repeat or press next to continue.
  lessonChoiceMessage: You have finished learning some of the words that ends with
    the rimes -em, -ell, and -eb. Would you like to repeat the lesson or you want
    to begin the quiz? Press repeat to repeat the lesson or press next to begin the
    quiz.
