  - title: Bell
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The first word you're going to learn is the word bell.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdc6a3aea2ff5e942acfe468d8784ebd, type: 3}
    - message: A bell makes a ringing sound when you shake or hit it.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3a34937174ddbd54fa9ba4e80af7363c, type: 3}
    - message: The word Bell begins with the initial letter B.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f49c759108bed3e40a8513262a3bd536, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter e, l, l.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5305269eee02e4b4b81c64dff5dc38b5, type: 3}
    - message: Since B is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b044310bb26699946bbab93e91c9d484, type: 3}
    - message: The word Bell ends with the rime -ell.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c67cc8b8b42c634ca0740dfb03f1df5, type: 3}
    practiceWord: bell
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Bell?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a4652f6142fd174f82876e51cd25f6d, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct!
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 806f9040f8926b94db47e2caef85d97b, type: 3}
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try Again.
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd615f4eef83e3b49b22a11445f9b6d6, type: 3}
    supportMessage: 'Remember, the word is Bell. Begin with a capital B, then type
      e, l, and l. '
    supportAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ed0a8d863bb53b45836b1b479067415, type: 3}
  - title: Well
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The next word you're going to learn is the word well.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08475738521f4fb49b6b7745c7a1bb4e, type: 3}
    - message: A well is a deep hole in the ground where people get water.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 506a7f3d8c5ca09469397771618ed768, type: 3}
    - message: The word Well begins with the initial letter W.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e845c6f74f50dd4f853b1dca53d80c2, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter e, l, l.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5305269eee02e4b4b81c64dff5dc38b5, type: 3}
    - message: Since W is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33485cfd767df814c8ba898dfba5d730, type: 3}
    - message: The word Well ends with the rime -ell. Same as Bell earlier.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e0900a8365ceeb438021ea6577b0e88, type: 3}
    practiceWord: well
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Well?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a77b4b1bb9ac7c849af8ec86e234b635, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct!
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 806f9040f8926b94db47e2caef85d97b, type: 3}
