  - title: Sell
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The next word you're going to learn is the word sell.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8fd0189c1af60844bf4211f583196cb, type: 3}
    - message: To sell means to give something to someone for money.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f699beda3106c5c42b1612795f22950a, type: 3}
    - message: The word Sell begins with the initial letter S.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee6125251ac62d84ca6134632bf92880, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by letter e, l, l.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5305269eee02e4b4b81c64dff5dc38b5, type: 3}
